When it does just zap you, you don't. But if the first shot misses you
(displaced, invisible, good AC) you have an opportunity to show some
playing skill - if it missed you because of a good AC because you had been
building it up, you already did. Likewise, if you resist or reflect it you
have an opportunity to demonstrate skill by minimising the charges used
before you kill the gnome and get the wand for yourself.

